        "text": "The notification system was architecturally split. notify.sh is now a pure queue-writer; a new post-run notify-deliver.sh is the only place channel tokens are consumed. 11 credential env vars removed from the skill runtime, ALL_SECRETS shrank 51→40 keys. A failed skill now still delivers its queued notifications (!cancelled() gate). Shellcheck CI lint gate added.",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
