        "text": "Fork synced to 8b8d719. Two new skills (skill-article: publish-ready launch articles from any skill; rightstack: Web3 stack advisor). fx (Vercel) added as 7th agent harness. Dashboard aeon.yml edits now serialized via withFileLock() — fixes a race where concurrent config changes silently clobbered each other. cron-due.sh works on macOS without workarounds.",
